### 1. System Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Company Telemetry & Metrics
GET http://localhost:3000/api/system-telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Department Status & Hierarchy
GET http://localhost:3000/api/department
Content-Type: application/json

### 3b. Engineering Department Toolchain & Environment Status
GET http://localhost:3000/api/department/tools/status
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Master Meta-Agent Observability
GET http://localhost:3000/api/meta/observe
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Knowledge Graph Summary
GET http://localhost:3000/api/knowledge/graph
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. List Autonomous Objectives
GET http://localhost:3000/api/objectives
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Trigger Autonomous Engineering Objective
POST http://localhost:3000/api/objectives/engineering
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "goal": "Verify environment configuration and system health",
  "priority": "normal",
  "maxRecoveryAttempts": 2
}
